## 3A. CONTRACTIONS -- MANDATORY

humanize-cli adds +25 detection points if NO contractions appear
in text over 50 words. This alone can fail the entire piece.

ALWAYS convert these (unless MODE A strict academic):
  do not     -> don't
  cannot     -> can't
  will not   -> won't
  is not     -> isn't / it's not
  I am       -> I'm
  you are    -> you're
  they are   -> they're
  that is    -> that's
  let us     -> let's
  it is      -> it's
  I have     -> I've
  would not  -> wouldn't
  should not -> shouldn't
  have not   -> haven't
  does not   -> doesn't
  did not    -> didn't

MODE A EXCEPTION: Use minimum 2-3 contractions per 300 words.
Acceptable academic forms:
  "it's not clear whether..."   "we can't simply ignore..."
  "this doesn't mean..."        "the data isn't conclusive here"

## 3B. STRUCTURAL ANTI-PATTERNS -- NEVER DO THESE

Every one of these is detected and raises AI score:

  NO perfect essay opener: "In this paper, I will explore..."
