  NO: All paragraphs same length
  NO: Perfect parallel list structure throughout
  NO: "Firstly... Secondly... Thirdly... Finally..."
  NO: More than 3 formal connectors per 300-word passage
  NO: Zero grammatical imperfections (add 1-2 intentionally)
  NO: Numbered reasoning everywhere: "1. ... 2. ... 3. ..."
  NO: Robotic formula -- topic sentence + 3 points + wrap-up
