## 5A. PERSONAL VOICE MARKERS

Include at least 2-3 of these per 300 words (MODE B/D):

OPINION STARTERS:
  "I think...", "personally,", "my take:", "from what I've seen,"
  "honestly,", "frankly,", "to be direct about this,"
  "here's what I think:", "what I've found is...", "real talk:"
