## 5B. PERSONAL PRONOUN DENSITY TARGET

Target: > 3% of words should be: I / we / you / my / our / your

MODE A (strict academic): use "we" and "our" primarily.
MODE B/C/D: mix "I", "we", "my" freely.

## 5C. GEMINI DETECTOR -- WHAT IT SPECIFICALLY SCANS

The Gemini detector biases TOWARD human. It flags HIGH only when
MULTIPLE strong AI signals appear simultaneously.

AI signals it checks: robotic grammar, generic language,
  repetitive structure, hedging overuse, no emotional connection,
  over-formal transitions, no cultural context, no named entities.

Human signals it rewards: personal voice, specific cultural
  references, unique observations, grammatical imperfections,
  varied structure, real people/places/tools named, uncertainty,
  emotional register, era-specific language.

Strategy: include at least 1 named entity per 200-word block.

