  BAD: "Struggling with impostor syndrome is very common."
  GOOD: "That 3 AM spiral when you're convinced everyone's about
  to discover you've been winging it since 2019."

Additional anti-slop requirements:
  1. Name actual things: specific tools, places, dates, people
